 "0001": {
  "title": "",
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "h4_00001",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[A1][/A1]NAME",
    "placeholders": {
     "A1": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_01\" id=\"tag_17_449_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "pthread_once — dynamic package initialization",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_02\" id=\"tag_17_449_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/pthread.h.html\">pthread.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint pthread_once(pthread_once_t *</tt><i>once_control</i><tt>,<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; void (*</tt><i>init_routine</i><tt>)(void));<br>\npthread_once_t</tt> <i>once_control</i> <tt>= PTHREAD_ONCE_INIT;<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_03\" id=\"tag_17_449_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The first call to [I5]pthread_once[/I5]() by any thread in a process, with a given [I6]once_control[/I6], shall call the\n[I7]init_routine[/I7] with no arguments. Subsequent calls of [I8]pthread_once[/I8]() with the same [I9]once_control[/I9] shall not call\nthe [I10]init_routine[/I10]. On return from [I11]pthread_once[/I11](), [I12]init_routine[/I12] shall have completed. The [I13]once_control[/I13]\nparameter shall determine whether the associated initialization routine has been called.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I10": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I13": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I14]pthread_once[/I14]() function is not a cancellation point. However, if [I15]init_routine[/I15] is a cancellation point and is\ncanceled, the effect on [I16]once_control[/I16] shall be as if [I17]pthread_once[/I17]() was never called.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I14": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I16": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I17": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "If the call to [I18]init_routine[/I18] is terminated by a call to [A19][I20]longjmp[/I20]()[/A19] or\n[A21][I22]siglongjmp[/I22]()[/A21], the behavior is undefined.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I18": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A19": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/longjmp.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I20": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A21": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/siglongjmp.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I22": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The constant PTHREAD_ONCE_INIT is defined in the [A23][I24]&lt;pthread.h&gt;[/I24][/A23] header.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A23": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/pthread.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I24": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     21,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The behavior of [I25]pthread_once[/I25]() is undefined if [I26]once_control[/I26] has automatic storage duration or is not initialized\nby PTHREAD_ONCE_INIT.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I25": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I26": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00011",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A27][/A27]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A27": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_04\" id=\"tag_17_449_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00012",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, [I28]pthread_once[/I28]() shall return zero; otherwise, an error number shall be returned to indicate\nthe error.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I28": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00013",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[A29][/A29]ERRORS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A29": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_05\" id=\"tag_17_449_05\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00014",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I30]pthread_once[/I30]() function shall not return an error code of [EINTR].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I30": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00015",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     35
    ],
    "text": "[A31][/A31]EXAMPLES",
    "placeholders": {
     "A31": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_06\" id=\"tag_17_449_06\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00016",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     37,
     1
    ],
    "text": "None.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00017",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     39
    ],
    "text": "[A32][/A32]APPLICATION USAGE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A32": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_07\" id=\"tag_17_449_07\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00018",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     41,
     1
    ],
    "text": "If [I33]init_routine[/I33] recursively calls [I34]pthread_once[/I34]() with the same [I35]once_control[/I35], the recursive call will not\ncall the specified [I36]init_routine[/I36], and thus the specified [I37]init_routine[/I37] will not complete, and thus the recursive call\nto [I38]pthread_once[/I38]() will not return. Use of [A39][I40]longjmp[/I40]()[/A39] or [A41][I42]siglongjmp[/I42]()[/A41] within an [I43]init_routine[/I43] to jump to a point outside of\n[I44]init_routine[/I44] prevents [I45]init_routine[/I45] from returning.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I33": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I34": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I35": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I36": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I37": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I38": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A39": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/longjmp.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I40": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A41": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/siglongjmp.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I42": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I43": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I44": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I45": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00019",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     43
    ],
    "text": "[A46][/A46]RATIONALE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A46": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_08\" id=\"tag_17_449_08\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00020",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     45,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Some C libraries are designed for dynamic initialization. That is, the global initialization for the library is performed when\nthe first procedure in the library is called. In a single-threaded program, this is normally implemented using a static variable\nwhose value is checked on entry to a routine, as follows:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00021",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     45,
     5
    ],
    "text": "To keep the same structure in a multi-threaded program, a new primitive is needed. Otherwise, library initialization has to be\naccomplished by an explicit call to a library-exported initialization function prior to any use of the library.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00022",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     45,
     7
    ],
    "text": "For dynamic library initialization in a multi-threaded process, if an initialization flag is used the flag needs to be protected\nagainst modification by multiple threads simultaneously calling into the library. This can be done by using a mutex (initialized by\nassigning PTHREAD_MUTEX_INITIALIZER). However, the better solution is to use [I47]pthread_once[/I47]() which is designed for exactly\nthis purpose, as follows:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I47": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00023",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     45,
     11
    ],
    "text": "If an implementation detects that the value specified by the [I48]once_control[/I48] argument to [I49]pthread_once[/I49]() does not\nrefer to a [B50]pthread_once_t[/B50] object initialized by PTHREAD_ONCE_INIT, it is recommended that the function should fail and\nreport an [EINVAL] error.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I48": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I49": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "B50": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00024",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     47
    ],
    "text": "[A51][/A51]FUTURE DIRECTIONS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A51": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_09\" id=\"tag_17_449_09\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00025",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     49,
     1
    ],
    "text": "None.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00026",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     51
    ],
    "text": "[A52][/A52]SEE ALSO",
    "placeholders": {
     "A52": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_10\" id=\"tag_17_449_10\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00027",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     53,
     1
    ],
    "text": "XBD [A53][I54]&lt;pthread.h&gt;[/I54][/A53]",
    "placeholders": {
     "A53": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/pthread.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I54": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00028",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     55
    ],
    "text": "[A55][/A55]CHANGE HISTORY",
    "placeholders": {
     "A55": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_11\" id=\"tag_17_449_11\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00029",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     57,
     1
    ],
    "text": "First released in Issue 5. Included for alignment with the POSIX Threads Extension.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00030",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     59
    ],
    "text": "[A56][/A56]Issue 6",
    "placeholders": {
     "A56": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_12\" id=\"tag_17_449_12\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00031",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     61,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I57]pthread_once[/I57]() function is marked as part of the Threads option.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I57": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00032",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     61,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [EINVAL] error is added as a &quot;may fail&quot; case for if either argument is invalid.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00033",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     63
    ],
    "text": "[A58][/A58]Issue 7",
    "placeholders": {
     "A58": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_13\" id=\"tag_17_449_13\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00034",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     65,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I59]pthread_once[/I59]() function is moved from the Threads option to the Base.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I59": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00035",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     65,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [EINVAL] error for an uninitialized [B60]pthread_once_t[/B60] object is removed; this condition results in undefined\nbehavior.",
    "placeholders": {
     "B60": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00036",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     65,
     5
    ],
    "text": "POSIX.1-2008, Technical Corrigendum 2, XSH/TC2-2008/0284 [863], XSH/TC2-2008/0285 [874], XSH/TC2-2008/0286 [874], and\nXSH/TC2-2008/0287 [747] are applied.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00037",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     67
    ],
    "text": "[A61][/A61]Issue 8",
    "placeholders": {
     "A61": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_449_14\" id=\"tag_17_449_14\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00038",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     69,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Austin Group Defect 1330 is applied, removing obsolescent interfaces.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
